model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Provider error scenarios require healthy GraphQL tools beside exact sanitized account discovery diagnostics. Explicit app-level discovery failures retain webhook setup refusal and all existing authentication, rate-limit, retry and tool-call recovery assertions. This carry changes only diagnostic test fixtures and assertions, never runtime behavior or deadlines. Account-scoped diagnostics occupy child router entries with the exact safe field schema; the healthy GraphQL tool remains the same callable tool rather than a replacement test stub."
    }
  }
}
